,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484265643,"data":"- random guess: top-1 = 1/8,192 = 0.00012, average rank = 4,096\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484310298,"data":"- control e5-\u003egtr (paper Table 1): top-1 0.96, average rank 1.10, cosine 0.22 / 0.49 / 0.51 (initial / refine-1 / refine-2). GATE: ours must reach top-1 \u003e= 0.85, else the notebook stops\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484317281,"data":"- fp32 BGE-large -\u003e GTR: unknown. The paper gets 0.96-0.99 for every pair into gtr, but with both sides from the same sentence pool. Our victim and attacker texts differ in style (A2b mixing 0.34-0.40 vs 0.5), and our map is 1024 -\u003e 768. Call it WORKS if top-1 \u003e= 0.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484321744,"data":"- int8, int4 vs fp32: within 0.02 top-1 (decoded cosine 0.99997 / 0.992: almost the same vectors)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484325395,"data":"- pq128x8 vs fp32: lower; decoded cosine 0.90. Guess: 0.0-0.2 below fp32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.48432893,"data":"- binary vs fp32: lower again; decoded cosine 0.79. Guess: 0.1-0.4 below fp32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484332418,"data":"- svd256 vs fp32: unknown: 256 -\u003e 768 map, 89% of the energy kept\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484335853,"data":"- spread over 3 seeds: small (paper: standard deviation mostly 0.00-0.01)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484339187,"data":"- supervised linear (pairs) vs mini-vec2vec: supervised \u003e= unsupervised; supervised MLP \u003e= supervised linear\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":22.484342845,"data":"- attacker-set rule (fixed 3 Nov): if 200k scores within 0.02 top-1 of the same-source set on fp32, use 200k only\n"}
